@startuml Class-DisplaySystem
!theme plain
title Display System - Visual Layer Architecture

class CharacterDisplay {
  - _character: Character
  - _piece_nodes: Array[TextureRect]
  - _content_size: Vector2
  - _is_facing_left: bool

  - bg_panel: Panel
  - layer_root: Control

  + set_character(c: Character): void
  + set_facing_left(facing_left): void

  - _redraw(): void
  - _update_flip_state(): void
  - _apply_bottom_center_anchor(): void
  - _update_global_scale(): void
}

class DisplayPiece {
  + texture: Texture2D
  + layer: int
  + modulate: Color
  + scale: Vector2
  + rotation_degrees: float
  + offset: Vector2
  + flip_h: bool
  + flip_v: bool
  + is_offhand_weapon: bool

  {static} + from_path(path, layer, tint): DisplayPiece
}

class DisplayBuilder <<Singleton>> {
  {static} - SPECIES_IMG_DIR: String
  {static} - EQUIPMENT_IMG_DIR: String
  {static} - WEAPONS_IMG_DIR: String

  + build_character_display(character): Array[DisplayPiece]
  + build_species_display(species): Array[DisplayPiece]
  + build_equipment_display(equipment): Array[DisplayPiece]

  + build_species_pieces(instance): Array[DisplayPiece]
  + build_equipment_pieces(equipment): EquipmentResult

  - _add_species_field(field, token, pieces, color, instance)
  - _deduplicate_equipment_by_type(equipment): Array
}

class "DisplayBuilder.EquipmentResult" as EquipmentResult {
  + pieces: Array[DisplayPiece]
  + hidden_species_layers: PackedInt32Array
}

class LayerManager <<Singleton>> {
  - _layer_mappings: Dictionary

  + get_layer_mapping(type_code): Array[int]
  + merge_and_sort_pieces(species, equipment, hidden): Array
  + sort_pieces_by_layer(pieces): Array
  + apply_layer_tints(pieces, color_map): Array
  + filter_hidden_layers(pieces, hidden): Array
}

enum ImageIdKind {
  EMPTY
  INVALID
  STATIC
  MODULAR_FULL
  MODULAR_GROUP_ONLY
}

class ImageId {
  {static} + parse(token): Dictionary
  {static} + to_static_id(image_num, layer): String
  {static} + to_modular_id(group, num, layer): String
}

ImageId ..> ImageIdKind : uses

CharacterDisplay "1" --> "1" Character : displays
CharacterDisplay "1" *-- "*" DisplayPiece : renders
CharacterDisplay ..> DisplayBuilder : uses

DisplayBuilder ..> DisplayPiece : creates
DisplayBuilder ..> LayerManager : uses
DisplayBuilder ..> ImageId : parses
DisplayBuilder --> EquipmentResult : returns

DisplayBuilder ..> Character : queries
DisplayBuilder ..> SpeciesInstance : queries
DisplayBuilder ..> EquipmentInstance : queries

note right of CharacterDisplay
  Godot Control node that:
  - Renders character visuals
  - Manages TextureRect children
  - Handles horizontal flipping
  - Applies species scale
  - Anchors to bottom-center

  Updates automatically via
  Character.model_changed signal.
end note

note right of DisplayBuilder
  Unified builder replacing:
  - SpeciesDisplayBuilder
  - EquipmentDisplayBuilder
  - SpeciesDisplayable

  Handles:
  - Species body part assembly
  - Equipment layer rendering
  - Color tinting
  - Layer conflict resolution
  - Off-hand transformations
end note

note bottom of DisplayPiece
  Immutable visual layer data:
  - Texture and Z-layer
  - Color modulation
  - Transform (scale, rotation, offset)
  - Flip flags

  Created by DisplayBuilder,
  consumed by CharacterDisplay.
end note

note left of LayerManager
  Layer management utilities:
  - Z-order sorting (0-999)
  - Species/equipment merging
  - Hidden layer filtering
  - Color tint application

  Ensures proper visual stacking
  of body parts and equipment.
end note

@enduml

' ================================================================================
' CLASS DIAGRAM - Core Management
' ================================================================================
@startuml Class-CoreManagement
!theme plain
title Core Management Layer - Data & Configuration

class ConfigManager <<Singleton>> {
  - _config_loaded: bool
  - _project_config: Dictionary

  + _ready(): void
  + get_config_value(key, default): Variant
  + load_project_config(): void

  - _boot_sequence(): void
  - _load_core_data(): void
}

class StarquillData <<Singleton>> {
  ' Species registry
  - _species_all: Array[Species]
  - _species_by_id: Dictionary

  ' Equipment catalog
  - _equipment_all: Array[CatalogItem]
  - _equipment_by_type: Dictionary
  - _equipment_by_slot_prefix: Dictionary

  ' Handheld catalog
  - _handheld_all: Array
  - _handheld_by_type: Dictionary

  ' Randomization settings
  - randomization_constants: Dictionary

  ' Species API
  + get_species_by_id(id): Species
  + get_all_species(): Array
  + create_species_instance(id): SpeciesInstance
  + create_random_species_instance(): SpeciesInstance

  ' Equipment API
  + get_equipment_by_type(type): CatalogItem
  + get_equipment_by_slot_prefix(prefix): Array
  + get_slot_for_item_type(type): String

  ' Handheld API
  + get_handheld_by_type(type): Dictionary
  + is_handheld_two_handed(type): bool
  + get_one_handed_handheld(): Array

  ' Data loading
  + load_species_from_json(path): void
  + load_equipment_catalog_from_json(path): void
  + load_handheld_catalog_from_json(path): void

  ' Modular parts
  {static} + pick_modular_image_num(code): String
}

class ColorManager <<Singleton>> {
  - _palettes: Dictionary

  + get_random_color_from_palette(name): Color
  + get_color_by_index(palette, index): Color
  + get_palette_hex(name): Array
  + load_palettes_from_json(path): void

  - _parse_color_keyword(keyword): Color
}

class PlayerData <<Singleton>> {
  - party: Party
  - current_world: String
  - save_data: Dictionary

  + initialize_new_game(): void
  + add_character(character): void
  + remove_character(character): void
  + save_game(): void
  + load_game(): void
}

class Game <<Singleton>> {
  + start_new_game(level_id, scene): void
  + go_to_next_level(from_id, to_id, scene): void

  - _create_test_party(): void
}

class SceneLoader <<Singleton>> {
  - _current_level_id: String
  - _current_scene: Node

  + swap_to(level_id, scene): void
  + get_current_level_id(): String

  - _unload_current(): void
  - _load_scene(scene): void
}

class Party {
  - members: Array[Character]
  - inventory: Inventory

  + add_member(character): void
  + remove_member(character): void
  + get_leader(): Character
}

ConfigManager --> StarquillData : initializes
ConfigManager --> ColorManager : initializes

StarquillData "1" *-- "*" Species : manages
StarquillData "1" *-- "*" CatalogItem : manages

Game --> PlayerData : creates party
Game --> SceneLoader : loads scenes
Game --> StarquillData : queries data

PlayerData "1" *-- "1" Party : has
Party "1" *-- "1..4" Character : contains

note right of ConfigManager
  Boot-time initialization:
  1. Load color palettes
  2. Load species data
  3. Load equipment catalog
  4. Load handheld catalog
  5. Emit boot_completed

  Single source of truth for
  project configuration.
end note

note right of StarquillData
  Unified data registry replacing:
  - species_loader
  - equipment_catalog
  - equipment_loader

  Provides:
  - Species creation APIs
  - Equipment lookup APIs
  - Randomization constants
  - Modular image selection

  All data loaded by ConfigManager
